---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import ScrollAnimations from '../components/ScrollAnimations.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    question: 'How often should I schedule commercial cleaning?',
    shortAnswer:
      'Most offices need weekly or biweekly cleaning, while restaurants, medical spaces, gyms, schools, and daycares may need daily or multiple-times-per-week service.',
    answer:
      "The right commercial cleaning schedule depends on your facility type, square footage, hours of operation, and daily foot traffic. Most Cleveland offices do well with weekly or biweekly cleaning, while restaurants, medical offices, gyms, schools, and daycares often need daily or multiple-times-per-week service to stay sanitary and inspection-ready. Flex Commercial Services also provides one-time deep cleans, monthly maintenance, and customized schedules for businesses that need seasonal or project-based support. During your free consultation, we review your space, restrooms, flooring, touch points, customer areas, and staff usage so we can recommend a realistic cleaning frequency instead of forcing every client into the same plan. The goal is to keep your facility consistently presentable without overpaying for service you do not need or under-scheduling work that affects customers, staff, inspections, or daily operations. We can revisit the schedule as your business grows or your building usage changes.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you bring your own supplies and equipment?',
    shortAnswer:
      'Yes. We bring professional-grade supplies, tools, and equipment, and we can follow any product preferences or facility-specific requirements you share.',
    answer:
      "Yes. Flex Commercial Services brings professional-grade cleaning supplies, tools, and equipment for routine janitorial work, restroom sanitation, floor care, dusting, high-touch disinfection, and specialty cleaning tasks. Businesses do not need to provide mops, vacuums, chemicals, trash liners, or standard cleaning products unless they have a specific preference. If your facility requires fragrance-free products, eco-conscious options, medical-grade disinfectants, or products approved for a restaurant, daycare, school, or healthcare environment, we can discuss those requirements during the quote process. Our goal is to make commercial cleaning simple for your team: we arrive prepared, follow the agreed scope, and keep your Cleveland or Northeast Ohio facility clean without adding supply management to your workload. If a client already has preferred products on site, we can also review those instructions and build them into the cleaning checklist. That keeps standards clear for every visit.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Are you insured and bonded?',
    shortAnswer:
      'Yes. Flex Commercial Services is insured and bonded for the protection and peace of mind of the businesses we serve.',
    answer:
      "Yes. Flex Commercial Services is insured and bonded for the protection of the businesses we serve across Cleveland and Northeast Ohio. That matters because commercial cleaning teams work inside offices, restaurants, medical facilities, schools, gyms, and other spaces where trust, access, and accountability are important. Insurance and bonding help protect both the client and the cleaning company if something unexpected happens during service. We also take a professional approach to communication, scheduling, and scope so every client knows what areas are being cleaned, when the work will happen, and who to contact with questions. For many facility managers and business owners, that combination of coverage, reliability, and direct accountability is essential when choosing a cleaning partner. If your organization requires proof of coverage before service begins, we can provide the documentation needed during onboarding.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you offer contracts or is it month-to-month?',
    shortAnswer:
      'We offer month-to-month service, longer-term cleaning contracts, and one-time cleaning contracts for special projects.',
    answer:
      "Flex Commercial Services offers flexible month-to-month cleaning, longer-term service contracts, and one-time cleaning contracts for single projects or special situations. Some Cleveland businesses prefer month-to-month service because their needs change with staffing, seasons, or customer volume. Others choose a longer-term contract when they want consistent weekly, daily, or multiple-times-per-week cleaning at a predictable schedule and price. We also handle one-time cleaning contracts for move-in and move-out projects, post-event cleanup, post-contractor cleanup, deep cleaning, floor care, and other situations where recurring service is not required. During the quote process, we help you choose the structure that fits your budget, facility requirements, and operational rhythm. That means you can start with a simple arrangement and adjust as your facility, hours, or cleaning priorities change. The agreement is built around the work your building actually needs and the standards you expect.",
  },
  {
    question: 'What industries do you serve?',
    shortAnswer:
      'We clean offices, restaurants, fitness centers, schools, daycares, medical facilities, move-in/move-out spaces, and post-contractor projects.',
    answer:
      "Flex Commercial Services provides commercial cleaning for offices, restaurants, fitness centers, schools, daycares, medical facilities, move-in and move-out spaces, and post-contractor cleanup projects across Cleveland and Northeast Ohio. Each industry has different cleaning priorities, so we adjust the scope instead of using one generic checklist. Offices often need dusting, trash removal, restroom care, floors, and high-touch disinfection. Restaurants need kitchens, dining rooms, restrooms, and inspection-focused cleaning. Fitness centers need equipment disinfection, locker room sanitation, and high-traffic floor care. Schools and daycares need child-conscious cleaning protocols. Medical spaces require more stringent sanitization. Move-out and contractor cleanup jobs need detailed dust removal, cabinet interiors, windows, bathrooms, and floor restoration after construction residue. If your industry is not listed, we can still review the space and recommend a practical cleaning scope. The quote process is where we match the checklist to your facility.",
  },
  {
    question: 'How do I get a quote?',
    shortAnswer:
      'Fill out the booking form or call (216)-801-9686. We review your space and respond within 24 hours.',
    answer:
      "You can get a commercial cleaning quote from Flex Commercial Services by filling out the booking form on our website or calling (216)-801-9686. The quote form asks for your name, contact information, business name, service type, approximate square footage, preferred cleaning frequency, and any details that help us understand your space. You can also upload photos to make the estimate more accurate. After receiving the request, we review the facility type, cleaning scope, schedule, and special requirements, then respond within 24 hours with next steps. Quotes are customized because a small office, restaurant, medical clinic, gym, school, and post-contractor cleanup project can all require different labor, products, equipment, and timing. The more detail you provide upfront, the easier it is for us to recommend the right plan. If needed, we can also discuss next steps by phone.",
  },
  {
    question: 'What makes Flex Commercial Services different from other cleaning companies?',
    shortAnswer:
      'We are a local, non-franchise cleaning company built by people who have done the work themselves.',
    answer:
      "Flex Commercial Services is different because the company was built from the ground up by people who have done the cleaning work themselves. We are not a franchise operation using a one-size-fits-all system. David George and Riley Hinkel started Flex after seeing how much a truly professional clean can change the way a business feels to customers, staff, patients, and visitors. That hands-on background still shapes how we quote, schedule, and complete each job. We focus on clear communication, tailored cleaning plans, reliable follow-through, and attention to detail across offices, restaurants, schools, gyms, medical spaces, move-out projects, and post-contractor cleanup work throughout Cleveland and Northeast Ohio. Clients work with a local team that understands both the labor and the business impact of a clean facility. That local accountability is part of the service experience.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you serve areas outside of Cleveland?',
    shortAnswer:
      'Yes. We serve Cleveland and surrounding Northeast Ohio communities including Lakewood, Parma, Strongsville, Beachwood, and Solon.',
    answer:
      "Yes. Flex Commercial Services serves Cleveland and the greater Northeast Ohio area, including nearby communities such as Lakewood, Parma, Strongsville, Beachwood, Solon, and surrounding cities. We work with local businesses that need routine janitorial service, office cleaning, restaurant cleaning, fitness center cleaning, school and daycare cleaning, medical facility sanitation, move-in and move-out cleaning, and post-contractor cleanup. Because every service area and schedule is a little different, we recommend contacting us to confirm availability for your exact location. If your business is outside Cleveland but still within Northeast Ohio, we can review your address, facility type, cleaning frequency, and timing needs during the quote process. Service-area availability may depend on route timing, project size, and whether the work is recurring or one time. The fastest way to confirm is to request a quote and share your address.",
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="FAQ | Flex Commercial Services Cleveland, OH"
  description="Get answers to common questions about commercial cleaning services from Flex Commercial Services in Cleveland, OH."
  breadcrumbLabel="FAQ"
  additionalSchema={[
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://flexcommercialservices.com/faq/#faqpage",
      "mainEntity": faqs.map((faq) => ({
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": faq.question,
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": faq.answer,
        },
      })),
    },
  ]}
>
  <Navbar />

  <!-- ── PAGE HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section
    class="pt-36 pb-20 text-center"
    style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #141414 50%, #0a0a0a 100%);"
  >
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="animate-on-scroll fade-up text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
        Cleveland Commercial Cleaning<br />
        <span class="text-brand-accent-dark">FAQ</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="animate-on-scroll fade-up stagger-1 text-brand-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Everything you need to know about working with Flex Commercial Services.
        Can't find your answer? Call us at&nbsp;
        <a href="tel:2168019686" class="text-brand-accent-dark hover:text-brand-accent font-semibold transition-colors">
          (216)-801-9686
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FAQ ACCORDION ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-brand-dark">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <FAQ items={faqs} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── BOTTOM CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-brand-navy">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="animate-on-scroll scale-in bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#2e2e2e] rounded-2xl p-10 md:p-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-3">Still Have Questions?</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-muted mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Our team is happy to help. Call us at <a href="tel:2168019686" class="text-brand-accent-dark hover:text-brand-accent font-semibold">(216)-801-9686</a> or get a free quote today, and we respond within 24 hours.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/booking" class="btn-primary px-8 py-4 text-base">Get a Free Quote</a>
          <a href="tel:2168019686" class="btn-outline  px-8 py-4 text-base">Call Us Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
  <ScrollAnimations />
</Layout>
